All 31 tests pass. I added `DRY_RUN` to the flag allowlist in `src/app.js` (parsing of the other flags untouched), and `main` now returns early after validation when it's present — emitting `dry-run port=… level=… capacity=…` and no queue. Invalid config still routes through the existing `ConfigError` handler with exit code 2. Added three tests covering `--DRY_RUN=1`, a bare `--DRY_RUN`, and the invalid-config path.
